WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.309 --> 00:00:20.593
"What?" Mayor Hubbletree and Pirate Pedro looked stunned.

2
00:00:21.673 --> 00:00:23.314
Mr. Freaky blew his noses.

3
00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:27.255
"You found Pedro's treasure?

4
00:00:28.015 --> 00:00:30.836
Are you sure it's buried at Monster Academy?"

5
00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:32.736
Ben nodded.

6
00:00:33.837 --> 00:00:37.198
He and the others quickly explained how they'd tracked down the treasure.

7
00:00:38.859 --> 00:00:40.100
Pedro looked excited.

8
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.061
"You aren't just trying to fool an old pirate, are you?"

9
00:00:44.081 --> 00:00:47.203
"No, sir," Mog said.

10
00:00:47.223 --> 00:00:51.364
"We found your treasure, but He looked down.

11
00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:58.107
"We wondered well we wondered "If you'd donate it to our school!"

12
00:00:58.487 --> 00:00:59.528
Winnie finished for him.

13
00:01:01.744 --> 00:01:05.466
"Of course, I'll donate the treasure to the school," Pedro replied.

14
00:01:05.486 --> 00:01:07.626
"I'm an old skeleton now.

15
00:01:07.947 --> 00:01:10.308
And I'd be proud to help Monster Academy."

16
00:01:12.088 --> 00:01:14.569
Mr. Freaky's noses twitched with delight.

17
00:01:14.589 --> 00:01:18.131
"Wonderful!" he cried.

18
00:01:18.151 --> 00:01:21.732
"With this treasure we'll be able to make the repairs!"

19
00:01:21.752 --> 00:01:26.694
"Great work, young monsters," Mayor Hubbletree declared.

20
00:01:26.714 --> 00:01:29.555
"Now take us to the treasure!"

21
00:01:32.532 --> 00:01:34.093
"Er Winnie checked the magic compass.

22
00:01:34.873 --> 00:01:38.374
"We don't know exactly where it is, but we know we're close."

23
00:01:40.215 --> 00:01:43.056
Gaby glanced at the tree and then back at the school building.

24
00:01:43.076 --> 00:01:46.638
"It's got to be inside the school."

25
00:01:46.658 --> 00:01:50.740
"You mean under the school," Ben said.

26
00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.761
"It might not be easy to dig up the school building."

27
00:01:53.781 --> 00:01:56.462
"Now wait a minute, students.

28
00:01:56.962 --> 00:02:00.043
Nobody is going to dig up Monster Academy!"

29
00:02:00.383 --> 00:02:01.344
Mr. Freaky said.

30
00:02:03.532 --> 00:02:06.615
"Hmm." Mayor Hubbletree rubbed his chin.

31
00:02:06.635 --> 00:02:11.940
"Actually, Freaky, I have a wonderful idea.

32
00:02:13.741 --> 00:02:18.065
We can just knock down your school and dig until we find the treasure."

33
00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:20.748
Mr. Freaky turned pale.

34
00:02:20.768 --> 00:02:23.350
"Knock down the school?"

35
00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.673
"It's the easiest and fastest way.

36
00:02:27.174 --> 00:02:33.422
Besides," the mayor added with a laugh, "your school is already falling apart."

37
00:02:34.463 --> 00:02:38.005
"You can't destroy our school," Mog said.

38
00:02:38.025 --> 00:02:42.248
"Of course I can," Mayor Hubbletree said.

39
00:02:42.268 --> 00:02:47.511
"People Place owns this land, in case you monsters have all forgotten.

40
00:02:48.772 --> 00:02:50.833
That makes the treasure mine.

41
00:02:51.654 --> 00:02:55.256
But because I'm such a nice guy, I'll share it with you.

42
00:02:56.652 --> 00:03:03.098
After we flatten Monster Academy, I'll use some of the treasure to build you a nice, new school."

43
00:03:03.118 --> 00:03:06.060
"But we like this school!"

44
00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.341
Gaby blurted out.

45
00:03:07.361 --> 00:03:10.664
"And it'll take years to build a new Monster Academy."

46
00:03:10.684 --> 00:03:13.726
"Nonsense," the mayor said.

47
00:03:13.746 --> 00:03:17.209
"You'll like your new school much better than this dump.

48
00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:23.234
We'll get rid of that nasty cafeteria and the library full of cobwebs."

49
00:03:24.295 --> 00:03:24.996
He shivered.

50
00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:31.081
"Not to mention the leaky roof, peeling paint, and broken windows."

51
00:03:32.982 --> 00:03:35.162
He pulled out his phone and began tapping.

52
00:03:35.182 --> 00:03:37.843
"There! It's all arranged.

53
00:03:38.383 --> 00:03:40.524
I've contacted People Place Wrecking.

54
00:03:41.864 --> 00:03:44.785
The bulldozers will be here at sunrise."

55
00:03:46.466 --> 00:03:48.106
All the monsters gasped.

56
00:03:48.126 --> 00:03:53.988
"Sunrise?" "Oh no!"

57
00:03:54.048 --> 00:03:55.008
Mr. Freaky wailed.

58
00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.461
"This is terrible!"

59
00:03:59.321 --> 00:04:01.022
But Mayor Hubbletree was beaming.

60
00:04:01.042 --> 00:04:06.143
"I'd better get some sleep.

61
00:04:07.183 --> 00:04:12.285
I want to be here at the crack of dawn when the bulldozers start rolling.

62
00:04:13.745 --> 00:04:15.166
Good night, everyone."

63
00:04:18.287 --> 00:04:22.668
With that, a limousine pulled up in front of the building and whisked the mayor away.

64
00:04:24.588 --> 00:04:28.190
The monsters stood on the steps in stunned silence for a moment.

65
00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:33.472
"I wish the office ogre were here right now," Mr.

66
00:04:33.532 --> 00:04:34.333
Freaky moaned.

67
00:04:36.213 --> 00:04:37.174
"Or Miss Bungle.

68
00:04:37.654 --> 00:04:39.135
She always knows what to do."

69
00:04:39.975 --> 00:04:41.616
He glanced quickly at the students.

70
00:04:41.636 --> 00:04:45.278
"I'll be in my office, thinking, if you need me."

71
00:04:48.339 --> 00:04:49.920
He headed for the building entrance.

72
00:04:51.156 --> 00:04:55.920
"I'll call your parents to let them know you're staying at Monster Academy tonight for a special project."

73
00:04:55.940 --> 00:05:01.445
"This is awful," Mog said.

74
00:05:01.465 --> 00:05:03.106
"What are we going to do?"

75
00:05:03.987 --> 00:05:05.568
Suddenly Pedro brightened.

76
00:05:05.588 --> 00:05:06.649
"I know!

77
00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.192
I'll gather my old pirate band!"

78
00:05:10.513 --> 00:05:12.214
He drew his sword and waved it.

79
00:05:12.234 --> 00:05:17.038
"We'll battle those bulldozers as if they were enemy ships.

80
00:05:17.579 --> 00:05:18.740
Don't worry, students!

81
00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:22.382
I'll be back at dawn with my crew to save the day!"

82
00:05:23.463 --> 00:05:25.444
Pedro hurried off into the darkness.

83
00:05:25.464 --> 00:05:28.406
"Whew!" Mog said.

84
00:05:28.426 --> 00:05:30.047
"That's a relief.

85
00:05:30.488 --> 00:05:32.949
The pirates are going to save Monster Academy."

86
00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:35.051
Winnie bit her lip.

87
00:05:35.871 --> 00:05:36.812
"I don't know, Mog.

88
00:05:37.292 --> 00:05:39.494
Pedro doesn't know anything about our school.

89
00:05:39.974 --> 00:05:41.475
Or the humans in People Place."

90
00:05:42.956 --> 00:05:44.537
"Yeah," Gaby added.

91
00:05:44.557 --> 00:05:48.080
"And what if Mayor Hubbletree keeps the treasure for himself?"

92
00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:52.761
"I don't think he'd do that," Ben said.

93
00:05:52.781 --> 00:05:55.843
"But we can't count on the grown-ups to save our school.

94
00:05:56.363 --> 00:06:01.326
There's only one thing to do—find the treasure ourselves, before sunrise!"

95
00:06:01.346 --> 00:06:04.568
"Yes!" the others cried.

96
00:06:05.789 --> 00:06:07.350
They all ran into the school.

97
00:06:12.093 --> 00:06:16.295
on the shadows in the painting, I think the treasure is buried on the east side of the

98
00:06:16.315 --> 00:06:17.736
building," Gaby said.

99
00:06:18.824 --> 00:06:20.946
"That's what the golden compass says too!"

100
00:06:21.426 --> 00:06:22.046
Winnie said.

101
00:06:22.066 --> 00:06:23.207
"Let's go!"

102
00:06:23.227 --> 00:06:26.449
The compass led them down a dark hallway.

103
00:06:33.014 --> 00:06:35.275
way," Winnie said, pointing to the right.

104
00:06:35.295 --> 00:06:40.118
"We take this turn and—" Boom!

105
00:06:40.539 --> 00:06:42.400
She slammed hard into a wall.
